  "memo": "This tree is known for its fragrant, creamy white flowers that bloom in the spring, filling the air with a delightful scent. Its dark green, glossy leaves provide a lush backdrop for the blossoms, making it a stunning addition to any urban landscape. The tree has a graceful, upright growth habit, often forming a dense canopy that offers ample shade. It thrives in well-drained soil and prefers a sunny spot, though it can tolerate partial shade. This tree is also relatively low-maintenance, requiring only occasional pruning to maintain its shape and health.",
